tive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
